    "title": "Keep item order and accept an oversized first item",
    "narrative": "Each call takes items from the front of `pending`. It stops when the next item would exceed capacity, unless the batch is empty. This preserves order and lets an oversized first item leave the queue. Capacity is therefore not a strict upper limit on batch weight.",
